  "ruleText": "Plc 608.02 Procedures for Disciplinary and Non-Disciplinary Remedial Proceedings and Imposing License Conditions. The procedures in Plc 311 shall govern disciplinary and non-disciplinary remedial proceedings and imposing license conditions.\n\nSource. #14631, eff 9-21-26, EXPIRES: 9-21-36",
